  "notes": "GitHub pack for Keyholder v0.1 (CONTRACT section 7). GraphQL is denied outright; billing is financial and denied; account SSH-key writes, gist writes, secret writes/rotation and repo deletion are hard denies (level 4). PR merges are destructive, approval-gated (level 3, fresh per-call approval) -- see W05 report re CONTRACT 'approval level 4' wording. Git-protocol pushes are NOT modelled here: if git interposition is not built, pushes bypass the broker and are not logged/gated (CONTRACT section 7); this pack must never be cited as covering git pushes. Comment-command patterns are denied via the github_comment body schema.",
